<title>POLAND: CSFB brokerage gets Polish secondary trade permit.</title>
<headline>CSFB brokerage gets Polish secondary trade permit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission (KPW) granted the brokerage of CS First Boston the right to trade shares of companies listed on the Warsaw Stock Exchange outside the bourse, the KPW said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said that under the permit, the first of its kind granted to a brokerage, CS First Boston would under certain conditions be allowed to buy shares at a bourse session in its own name and re-sell them later to its clients.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
